    description: Some("Four flocks of mutated phoenixes bomb a lone laser cannon, and the big ones regrow any wing you clip unless the shot lands dead centre. A force field shields the cannon for a second and a half but pins it in place while up. Behind the birds sits a mothership whose rotating hull layer has to be timed to expose the pilot."),
